  <item>
    <title>「她行」是一片回响池：我们在这里交换信任与勇气</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68209b3524f855934608069d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68209b3524f855934608069d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 May 2025 12:50:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「她行」出品的她声Her Voice，关于理工科女性的职场与生活故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>💃播客主持人：Moon</span></p><span></span><p><span>💗本期内容包括：/女性互助/自我认同/情绪平衡</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌟本期节目邀请了她行本期冬季活动的🎤两位Mentors：Tong，Jane。</span><br><span>二位在节目中分享了她们参与她行mentorship的契机以及与mentee互动的点滴，看到mentee们从“害怕提问”到“勇敢表达”，有时候我们需要的是一个可以说“我不知道”的空间。她行带来的是一次又一次“身份的流动”，在这里，mentor和mentee的身份可以自由切换，每一次反馈与对话，不仅是一次新的自己被唤醒，也关乎信任、成长与自我更新。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> &nbsp;节目介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="54">00:54</a> &nbsp;嘉宾自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="212">03:32</a> &nbsp;参与她行项目的契机与感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="402">06:42</a> &nbsp;Mentorship的意义与分享互助的文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="772">12:52</a> &nbsp;拒绝提问羞耻，勇敢表达自己的声音</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1210">20:10</a> &nbsp;每期项目身份可自由互换，她行是一方成长轮回的池塘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1511">25:11</a> &nbsp;在社群分享交流中重新回顾自我，迭代更新</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1857">30:57</a> &nbsp;参加她行的收获与未来期望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2044">34:04</a> &nbsp;女性社群里的纯粹信任</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2343">39:03</a> &nbsp;每期活动的迭代反馈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2807">46:47</a> &nbsp;她行的活动设计和志愿组织</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3296">54:56</a> &nbsp;女性互助与正向反馈，用行动对抗无力感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3536">58:56</a> &nbsp;女性无限的可能性</span></p>]]></description>
