    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67fbc33b59699d74dc704010</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67fbc33b59699d74dc704010</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 14:13:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「她行」出品的她声Her Voice，关于理工科女性的职场与生活故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>💃播客主持人：竹一</span></p><span></span><p><span>💗本期内容包括：职场女性成长/女性互助/自我认同/情绪平衡</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌟本期节目邀请了她行本期冬季活动的🎤Mentor：Sweets，迭依。二位在节目中分享了她们首次参与她行mentorship的契机以及与mentee互动的点滴，还分享了各自在职场中面对目标设定、年龄焦虑、自我认同等议题时的思考与经验。从1v1交流到圆桌活动，从团队协作到leader视角，她们用亲身经历诠释了什么是女性之间的支持与成长。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期shownotes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a> 嘉宾自我介绍以及参加她行的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="293">04:53</a> 冬季项目的参与感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="543">09:03</a> sweets分享创业相关以及与mentee开展的圆桌活动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="796">13:16</a> 迭依分享自己与mentee 1v1交流</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="954">15:54</a> 迭依分享与别的mentor的进行职业咨询和信息交流</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1089">18:09</a> sweets分享自己帮助mentee解决相关工作上的困惑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1253">20:53</a> 融入职场和融入「她行」社群，有什么区别呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1893">31:33</a> leader视角如何看待团队成员的付出和努力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2004">33:24</a> 职场新人如何长远地规划自己的未来？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2204">36:44</a> 拆解长期目标落实到实处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2606">43:26</a> 有意识地不拿他人标准来评判自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2857">47:37</a> 日常学习和精力平衡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3409">56:49</a> 如何看待35岁门槛的年龄焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3670">61:10</a> 在「她行」社群拥有保持分享传递经验的正反馈</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎧 快来收听本期节目，与我们一起感受她行 Mentorship 的力量吧！</span></p>]]></description>
